    <!-- FAQ (Accordion) -->
    <section id="faq" class="py-20 md:py-24 bg-white text-slate-800">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12">
        <span class="reveal inline-block text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#106367] mb-3 transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-6 data-[state~=visible]:opacity-100 data-[state~=visible]:translate-y-0">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="reveal font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-4 transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-6 data-[state~=visible]:opacity-100 data-[state~=visible]:translate-y-0">Pertanyaan Umum</h2>
        <p class="reveal text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12 transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-6 data-[state~=visible]:opacity-100 data-[state~=visible]:translate-y-0">
          Jawaban untuk pertanyaan yang sering kami terima. Belum terjawab?
          Hubungi kami via WhatsApp.
        </p>

        <div class="reveal max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-4 transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 translate-y-6 data-[state~=visible]:opacity-100 data-[state~=visible]:translate-y-0">
          <div class="faq-item group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition-all duration-200 data-[state~=open]:border-[#106367] data-[state~=open]:shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-question flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-left text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:text-[#106367] group-data-[state~=open]:bg-teal-50/40 group-data-[state~=open]:text-[#106367]">
              Berapa lama waktu pengerjaan laundry?
              <span class="text-2xl text-[#106367] transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0 group-data-[state~=open]:rotate-45 leading-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden group-data-[state~=open]:block px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 bg-teal-50/20">
              Waktu pengerjaan tergantung layanan yang dipilih:<br /><br />
              • <strong>Reguler:</strong> 1–2 hari kerja<br />
              • <strong>Express:</strong> 3–5 jam (minimal 3 kg, antrean diprioritaskan)<br />
              • <strong>Karpet/Sepatu:</strong> 2–3 hari kerja<br /><br />
              Waktu dihitung sejak barang diterima dan di-note, bukan sejak pemesanan.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition-all duration-200 data-[state~=open]:border-[#106367] data-[state~=open]:shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-question flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-left text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:text-[#106367] group-data-[state~=open]:bg-teal-50/40 group-data-[state~=open]:text-[#106367]">
              Bagaimana kebijakan ganti rugi jika pakaian rusak atau hilang?
              <span class="text-2xl text-[#106367] transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0 group-data-[state~=open]:rotate-45 leading-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden group-data-[state~=open]:block px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 bg-teal-50/20">
              Kami bertanggung jawab penuh atas kerusakan yang disebabkan oleh kelalaian proses kami. Kompensasi maksimal adalah <strong>5× tarif cuci item tersebut</strong>.<br /><br />
              Pengecualian: Kerusakan pada pakaian kategori Yellow Flag (luntur, sablon rusak, manik lepas) yang sudah dikonfirmasi risikonya oleh pelanggan sebelum proses, tidak termasuk dalam tanggungan.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition-all duration-200 data-[state~=open]:border-[#106367] data-[state~=open]:shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-question flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-left text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:text-[#106367] group-data-[state~=open]:bg-teal-50/40 group-data-[state~=open]:text-[#106367]">
              Apakah tersedia layanan antar-jemput? Bagaimana caranya?
              <span class="text-2xl text-[#106367] transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0 group-data-[state~=open]:rotate-45 leading-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden group-data-[state~=open]:block px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 bg-teal-50/20">
              Ya! Layanan antar-jemput tersedia untuk area Kabupaten Bojonegoro dalam radius 5 km dari toko kami.<br /><br />
              • <strong>Jemput:</strong> Pesan via WhatsApp, kami jemput dalam 1–2 jam (sesuai jadwal)<br />
              • <strong>Antar:</strong> Dilakukan otomatis saat cucian selesai dan Anda konfirmasi<br />
              • <strong>Ongkir:</strong> Rp 5.000/sekali jalan. Gratis untuk pesanan &ge; 5 kg dalam radius 3 km.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition-all duration-200 data-[state~=open]:border-[#106367] data-[state~=open]:shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-question flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-left text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:text-[#106367] group-data-[state~=open]:bg-teal-50/40 group-data-[state~=open]:text-[#106367]">
              Bolehkah saya memilih pewangi atau deterjen tertentu?
              <span class="text-2xl text-[#106367] transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0 group-data-[state~=open]:rotate-45 leading-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden group-data-[state~=open]:block px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 bg-teal-50/20">
              Boleh! Kami menyediakan beberapa pilihan pewangi (lavender, fresh cotton, dan unscented untuk kulit sensitif). Informasikan preferensi saat serah terima atau via catatan di WhatsApp. Tidak ada biaya tambahan untuk pilihan pewangi standar.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition-all duration-200 data-[state~=open]:border-[#106367] data-[state~=open]:shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-question flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-left text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:text-[#106367] group-data-[state~=open]:bg-teal-50/40 group-data-[state~=open]:text-[#106367]">
              Apakah PJ Laundry buka setiap hari? Jam berapa?
              <span class="text-2xl text-[#106367] transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0 group-data-[state~=open]:rotate-45 leading-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden group-data-[state~=open]:block px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 bg-teal-50/20">
              Kami buka setiap hari:<br /><br />
              • <strong>Senin – Jumat:</strong> 08.00 – 20.00 WIB<br />
              • <strong>Sabtu:</strong> 08.00 – 18.00 WIB<br />
              • <strong>Minggu &amp; Hari Libur Nasional:</strong> 09.00 – 15.00 WIB<br /><br />
              Pemesanan WhatsApp bisa dilakukan 24 jam, namun konfirmasi dilayani pada jam operasional.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white transition-all duration-200 data-[state~=open]:border-[#106367] data-[state~=open]:shadow-md overflow-hidden">
            <button aria-expanded="false" class="faq-question flex w-full cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 md:p-6 text-left text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 transition-colors hover:text-[#106367] group-data-[state~=open]:bg-teal-50/40 group-data-[state~=open]:text-[#106367]">
              Bagaimana cara saya melacak status cucian saya?
              <span class="text-2xl text-[#106367] transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0 group-data-[state~=open]:rotate-45 leading-none">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer hidden group-data-[state~=open]:block px-5 md:px-6 pb-6 pt-1 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600 border-t border-slate-100 bg-teal-50/20">
              Setiap cucian mendapat <strong>nomor nota unik</strong> yang dikirim via WhatsApp saat barang diterima. Anda bisa menanyakan status dengan menyebutkan nomor nota tersebut kapan saja via WhatsApp kami.<br /><br />
              Notifikasi otomatis juga dikirim ketika status berubah: diterima &rarr; dalam proses &rarr; selesai &rarr; siap diambil.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
